sequenceDiagram
    actor "Flutter Mobile Client" as FlutterMobileClient
    participant "External Payment Platform" as ExternalPaymentPlatform
    participant ".NET 8 Modular Monolith" as NET8ModularMonolith

    activate FlutterMobileClient
    FlutterMobileClient->>FlutterMobileClient: 1. User taps 'Upgrade to Premium' button.
    activate ExternalPaymentPlatform
    FlutterMobileClient->>ExternalPaymentPlatform: 2. InitiateInAppPurchase(planId)
    ExternalPaymentPlatform-->>FlutterMobileClient: PurchaseResult (Success, Canceled, Failed)
    ExternalPaymentPlatform->>ExternalPaymentPlatform: 3. User completes the purchase via native payment sheet.
    ExternalPaymentPlatform->>FlutterMobileClient: 4. Return PurchaseResult: Success
    activate NET8ModularMonolith
    ExternalPaymentPlatform->>NET8ModularMonolith: 5. POST /api/v1/webhooks/subscriptions
    NET8ModularMonolith-->>ExternalPaymentPlatform: 200 OK | 4xx/5xx Error
    NET8ModularMonolith->>NET8ModularMonolith: 6. ValidateWebhookSignature(payload)
    NET8ModularMonolith-->>NET8ModularMonolith: ValidationResult (Valid/Invalid)
    NET8ModularMonolith->>NET8ModularMonolith: 7. ProcessSubscriptionEvent(event)
    NET8ModularMonolith-->>NET8ModularMonolith: ProcessingResult
    NET8ModularMonolith->>NET8ModularMonolith: 7.1. DB: Find User, Update SubscriptionTier='Premium', Set ExpiryDate, Log Audit Event
    NET8ModularMonolith-->>NET8ModularMonolith: Success/Failure
    NET8ModularMonolith->>ExternalPaymentPlatform: 8. HTTP 200 OK
    FlutterMobileClient->>NET8ModularMonolith: 9. GET /api/v1/users/me
    NET8ModularMonolith-->>FlutterMobileClient: User Profile DTO (with Premium status)
    NET8ModularMonolith->>FlutterMobileClient: 10. Return User Profile DTO
    FlutterMobileClient->>FlutterMobileClient: 11. Update UI to unlock premium features.

    note over FlutterMobileClient: Client-side success is only provisional. The UI must show a 'Verifying...' or similar state until...
    note over NET8ModularMonolith: Idempotency is CRITICAL. The webhook handler in MOD-MONETIZATION must use the unique transaction ...
    note over NET8ModularMonolith: Webhook is the single source of truth for all subscription lifecycle events (purchase, renewal, c...

    deactivate NET8ModularMonolith
    deactivate ExternalPaymentPlatform
    deactivate FlutterMobileClient
